        <activityName xml:lang="en">Gold, primary, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Gold, primary, at refinery
This data set describes the composition of primary gold production from at a global level.;
CAS number: 007440-57-5; 
UUID: ebbf5879-0db9-30c2-901e-eee79b408978
none
Location: global data
Technology: Assumption on classification of the production countries has been made, based on global production statistics.
Time period: Period of public statistics
Production volume: 2533 t gold
Sampling: Production statistics, based on average production rate 2000-2004 
Extrapolations: The energy use, materials, emissions and land use of the mining and beneficiation are considered in the corresponding datasets at country level. 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_ebbf5879-0db9-30c2-901e-eee79b408978.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
